# a template (templates.c): HOME > SEL, the TEMPLATE row turned with ALGO, SEL twice (the ask), and the project is
# a doomgaze set: tempo, kit, three scenes of beats, the progression on the conductor, five sounds, the FX, the song
wait 200
master 4096
tap HOME
tap SEL
wait 40
row TEMPLATE
wait 40
shot template_row.png
tap SEL
wait 40
shot template_ask.png
tap SEL
wait 100
shot template_done.png
expect tempo 160
expect par9.e3 1
expect par9.e2 4
expect par2.0 11
expect par3.0 0
expect par4.0 11
expect par12.0 15
expect songlen 3
expect scene 1
steps 1 1
steps 1 2
steps 9 1
expect note 9 1 1 64
# it plays: the song from the top, a bar of each
wav template.wav
tap PLAY
bars 4
wavstop
tap PLAY
stats
# the next template, and back to a plain new project
tap HOME
tap SEL
row TEMPLATE
spin ALGO 1
wait 40
shot template_next.png
tap SEL
tap SEL
wait 100
expect tempo 190
